WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:02.025
Check yourself with two questions.

2
00:00:02.025 --> 00:00:05.975
First: a public I P is
attached to a NAT gateway.

3
00:00:05.975 --> 00:00:08.462
What does DDoS Network
Protection do for it?

4
00:00:08.462 --> 00:00:10.350
The answer is b, nothing.

5
00:00:10.350 --> 00:00:14.590
Learn's tier comparison says NAT
gateway I Ps aren't supported,

6
00:00:14.590 --> 00:00:17.250
so the guide lists them as an exclusion.

7
00:00:17.250 --> 00:00:21.225
Second: a web application
firewall policy shows Detection.

8
00:00:21.225 --> 00:00:23.275
What happens to an attack request?

9
00:00:23.275 --> 00:00:26.900
The answer is b: it's logged
and forwarded to the backend.

10
00:00:26.900 --> 00:00:28.787
Only prevention mode blocks.

11
00:00:28.787 --> 00:00:33.770
The module page has three more questions,
each linked to the unit that answers it.
